EmailPowerEvalBody=We have completed our technical evaluation of our on site generators. We expect limited power access to the entire building, and have upgraded the surge protection to protect the building. When City restores the power, we expect immediate restoration of all systems without interrupt.
EmailPowerEvalDate=Sat, June 30th, 2007
EmailPowerEvalFrom=Hantz Center Maintenance
EmailPowerEvalSubject=Power System Evaluation
EmailPowerEvalTo=Displace_All

EmailMeetRoomCodeBody=Matt... I got the code to the VIP meeting room. 2346. Talk to some of the guys and see if they know the office code. Don't let Milan found out. I got a bad feeling about that guy.
EmailMeetRoomCodeDate=Fri, June 29th, 2007
EmailMeetRoomCodeFrom=Gilley
EmailMeetRoomCodeSubject=Meeting Room code
